you already hold some).</p></li><li class="bitcoin-page__guide-step"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><p>Tap Buy and enter the dollar amount you need for your order — leave a little room for network fees.</p></li><li class="bitcoin-page__guide-step"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span><p>Review the purchase details, confirm, then tap Done.</p></li></ol></div></section><section id="send" class="section-shell bitcoin-page__guide animate-soft-in" style="animation-delay: 100ms;"><div class="bitcoin-page__guide-card bitcoin-page__guide-card--accent"><header class="bitcoin-page__guide-header"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-label">Part 2</span><h2 class="bitcoin-page__guide-title">Send Bitcoin to your Arail invoice</h2><p class="bitcoin-page__guide-desc">Use the address and amount shown on BTCPay — not a screenshot from earlier. Stay on the invoice page until payment confirms.</p></header><ol class="bitcoin-page__guide-steps"><li class="bitcoin-page__guide-step"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><p>Keep your Arail BTCPay invoice open — you’ll need the address and the exact BTC amount shown.</p></li><li class="bitcoin-page__guide-step"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><p>In Cash App, open the Money tab and select Bitcoin.</p></li><li class="bitcoin-page__guide-step"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><p>Tap Send or receive, then choose Send bitcoin.</p></li><li class="bitcoin-page__guide-step"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span><p>Enter the exact BTC amount from the invoice (copy-paste). Sending the wrong amount can delay automatic confirmation.</p></li><li class="bitcoin-page__guide-step"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-num" aria-hidden="true">5</span><p>Paste the Bitcoin address from BTCPay. Double-check every character — transfers can’t be reversed.</p></li><li class="bitcoin-page__guide-step"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-num" aria-hidden="true">6</span><p>Pick a withdrawal speed (faster options cost more). Confirm the details, enter your Cash PIN, and send.</p></li><li class="bitcoin-page__guide-step"><span class="bitcoin-page__guide-num" aria-hidden="true">7</span><p>Wait for network confirmation. Cash App will notify you when it lands; BTCPay will mark the order paid once it sees the payment.</p></li></ol></div></section><section id="tips" class="section-shell bitcoin-page__tips animate-soft-in" style="animation-delay: 140ms;"><header class="bitcoin-page__section-header"><h2 class="bitcoin-page__section-title">Before you send</h2><p class="bitcoin-page__section-desc">Quick checks that prevent most payment delays.</p></header><ul class="bitcoin-page__tip-list"><li class="surface-card bitcoin-page__tip"><h3 class="bitcoin-page__tip-title">Verify your Cash App identity first</h3><p class="bitcoin-page__tip-desc">Bitcoin buy/send usually needs ID verification (name, DOB, SSN last four, and a government ID) before those features unlock.</p></li><li class="surface-card bitcoin-page__tip"><h3 class="bitcoin-page__tip-title">Match the invoice amount exactly</h3><p class="bitcoin-page__tip-desc">Paste the BTC amount from BTCPay — don’t round. Conversion mismatches can leave the invoice unpaid until support reviews it.</p></li><li class="surface-card bitcoin-page__tip"><h3 class="bitcoin-page__tip-title">Fees and speed trade off</h3><p class="bitcoin-page__tip-desc">Cash App charges more for faster withdrawals. If you’re not in a rush, a slower option is usually cheaper — just finish before the invoice timer expires.</p></li><li class="surface-card bitcoin-page__tip"><h3 class="bitcoin-page__tip-title">Stuck or pending?</h3><p class="bitcoin-page__tip-desc">Confirm the address, check your Cash App Bitcoin limits (Profile → Cash Support → search “Limits”), and allow time for the speed you chose.</p></li></ul></section><section class="section-shell bitcoin-page__trust"><div class="surface-card bitcoin-page__trust-grid"><div class="bitcoin-page__trust-card"><div class="bitcoin-page__trust-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-[var(--accent)]"><rect x="4.5" y="8.5" width="11" height="8" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"></rect><path d="M7 8.5V6.8a3 3 0 0 1 6 0V8.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"></path><circle cx="10" cy="12.5" r="1" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></div><h3 class="bitcoin-page__trust-title">Secure gateway</h3><p class="bitcoin-page__trust-desc">BTCPay Server — no third-party payment processors.</p></div><div class="bitcoin-page__trust-card"><div class="bitcoin-page__trust-icon"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0" src="/assets/img/bitcoin-logo.svg" style="width: 20px; height: 20px; display: block;"></div><h3 class="bitcoin-page__trust-title">Bitcoin accepted</h3><p class="bitcoin-page__trust-desc">Pay directly in BTC at checkout.</p></div><div class="bitcoin-page__trust-card"><div class="bitcoin-page__trust-icon"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="shrink-0 text-[var(--accent)]"><path d="M3.4 6.8 10 3.4l6.6 3.4v6.8L10 16.6 3.4 13.6V6.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M3.4 6.8 10 10.2l6.6-3.4M10 10.2v6.4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="m6.2 5.4 7.6 3.9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" opacity="0.85"></path></svg></div><h3 class="bitcoin-page__trust-title">Discreet shipping</h3><p class="bitcoin-page__trust-desc">Plain packaging with no product labels on the outside.</p></div></div></section><section class="section-shell bitcoin-page__note"><div class="bitcoin-page__note-card"><h3 class="bitcoin-page__note-title">Other wallets</h3><p class="bitcoin-page__note-desc">Prefer Coinbase, Kraken, Binance, or Bitcoin.com? Buy there, then send to the same BTCPay address and amount. Always paste values from the live invoice — rates are locked only for that payment window.</p></div></section></div></main>

